Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:41:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Export statically named dynamic Space references

Analyze the possible named reference mappings in Space formula source and apply the formula when instantiating an exported ItemSpace. Verify exported values against live modelx, and reject unsupported computed, mutated or shadowed mappings during export.
